[I] Recursive-descent parser generators for C

[T] peg and leg are tools for generating recursive-descent parsers in C from
[T] parsing expression grammars. peg uses the original PEG syntax, while leg
[T] offers a slightly different syntax designed to be familiar to lex and
[T] yacc users.

[U] https://piumarta.com/software/peg/

[A] Peg Authors
